               3                     !
               4                     !     ******************************************************************
               5                     !     *                                                                *
               6                     !     *  subroutine for grid-scale condensation & evaporation          *
               7                     !     *  for the mrf model at ncep.                                    *
               8                     !     *                                                                *
               9                     !     ******************************************************************
              10                     !     *                                                                *
              11                     !     *  created by:   q.  zhao         jan. 1995                      *
